<script>
function PrintDiv() {
    var restorepage = document.body.innerHTML;
    //document.getElementById('ShowMore').style.display = 'block';
    var printcontent = document.getElementById('PrintDivID').innerHTML;
    document.body.innerHTML = printcontent;
    window.print();
    document.body.innerHTML = restorepage;
};

function ToggleText() {
    var text = document.getElementById('ToggleLink').innerHTML;
    if (text != 'Hide Details') {
        text = 'Hide Details';
    }
    else {
        text = 'Details...';
    }
    document.getElementById('ToggleLink').innerHTML = text;
};
</script>

<div id="PrintDivID">
    
        <div>
            <br>
            <h3 style="text-align:center">
            <strong>Classification of Individual Consumption According to Purpose 1999</strong>
            </h3>
            <br>
        </div>
    <div class="headline"><h4>Basic Bibliographic Information</h4></div>
    <div style="margin-left:20px; margin-bottom:20px">
        <div class="DtlCol2-1 DtlTitle">&bull; Status:</div>
        <div class="DtlCol2-2 DtlCell"><span style="color:red">Superseded</span>
        <span> [The current version is <a target="_blank" href="/unsd/classifications/Family/Detail/2094">COICOP 2018</a>]</span>
        </div>
        <div class="DtlCol2-1 DtlTitle">&bull; Type:</div>
        <div class="DtlCol2-2 DtlCell">To Be Determined</div>
        <div class="DtlCol2-1 DtlTitle">&bull; Citation:</div>
        <div class="DtlCol2-2 DtlCell">Classifications of expenditure according to purpose: COFOG, COICOP, COPNI, COPP, Series M: Miscellaneous Statistical Papers, No. 84, New York: United Nations. 
ST/ESA/STAT/SER.M/84</div>
        <div class="DtlCol2-1 DtlTitle">&bull; ISBN:</div>
        <div class="DtlCol2-2 DtlCell">92-1-161420-1</div>
        <div class="DtlCol2-1 DtlTitle">&bull; Website:</div>
        <div class="DtlCol2-2 DtlCell"><a target="_blank" href=https://unstats.un.org/unsd/classifications/econ/>https://unstats.un.org/unsd/classifications/econ/</a></div>
        <div class="DtlCol2-1 DtlTitle">&bull; Custodian:</div>
        <div class="DtlCol2-2 DtlCell">United Nations Statistics Division</div>
        <div class="DtlCol2-1 DtlTitle">&bull; Available Formats:</div>
        <div class="DtlCol2-2 DtlCell">HTML, Text, RDF, Access</div>
        <div class="DtlCol2-1 DtlTitle">&bull; Year Adopted:</div>
        <div class="DtlCol2-2 DtlCell">1999</div>
        <div class="DtlCol2-1 DtlTitle">&bull; Year Published:</div>
        <div class="DtlCol2-2 DtlCell">2000</div>
            <div class="DtlCol2-1 DtlTitle">Available Languages (besides English):</div>
<div class="DtlCol2-2 DtlCell">Français, Español, العربية, Pусский, 中文 <a id="ToggleLink" onclick="javascript:ToggleText()" href="#ToggleDiv" data-toggle="collapse" class="hidden-print">Details...</a></div><div id="ToggleDiv" class="collapse">            <div><div class="DtlLangs-1 DtlSubItem">Fran&#231;ais</div><div class="DtlLangs-2"><div class="DtlLangs-2a DtlCell">Nomenclature des fonctions de la consommation individuelle (COICOP)</div>
<div class="DtlLangs-2b DtlTitle">Citation:</div><div class="DtlLangs-2c DtlCell">Nomenclature des d&#233;penses par fonction: COFOG, COICOP, COPNI, COPP, S&#233;rie M: No 84, New York: Nations Unies.
ST/ESA/STAT/SER.M/84</div>            <div class="DtlLangs-2b DtlTitle">ISBN:</div><div class="DtlLangs-2c DtlCell">92-1-261174-5</div>            <div class="DtlLangs-2a DtlCell"><a target="_blank" href=http://unstats.un.org/unsd/cr/registry/regdntransfer.asp?f=5>http://unstats.un.org/unsd/cr/registry/regdntransfer.asp?f=5</a></div>            </div></div>
            <div><div class="DtlLangs-1 DtlSubItem">Espa&#241;ol</div><div class="DtlLangs-2"><div class="DtlLangs-2a DtlCell">Clasificaci&#243;n del consumo individual por finalidades (CCIF)</div>
<div class="DtlLangs-2b DtlTitle">Citation:</div><div class="DtlLangs-2c DtlCell">Clasificaciones de gastos por finalidades: COFOG, COICOP, COPNI, COPP, Serie M: No. 84, New York: Naciones Unidas.
ST/ESA/STAT/SER.M/84</div>            <div class="DtlLangs-2b DtlTitle">ISBN:</div><div class="DtlLangs-2c DtlCell">92-1-361194-3</div>            <div class="DtlLangs-2a DtlCell"><a target="_blank" href=http://unstats.un.org/unsd/cr/registry/regdntransfer.asp?f=174>http://unstats.un.org/unsd/cr/registry/regdntransfer.asp?f=174</a></div>            </div></div>
            <div><div class="DtlLangs-1 DtlSubItem">العربية</div><div class="DtlLangs-2"><div class="DtlLangs-2a DtlCell">-</div>
<div class="DtlLangs-2b DtlTitle">Citation:</div><div class="DtlLangs-2c DtlCell">ST/ESA/STAT/SER.M/84</div>                        <div class="DtlLangs-2a DtlCell"><a target="_blank" href=http://unstats.un.org/unsd/cr/registry/regdntransfer.asp?f=224>http://unstats.un.org/unsd/cr/registry/regdntransfer.asp?f=224</a></div>            </div></div>
            <div><div class="DtlLangs-1 DtlSubItem">Pусский</div><div class="DtlLangs-2"><div class="DtlLangs-2a DtlCell">Классификация индивидуального потребления по целям (КИПЦ)</div>
<div class="DtlLangs-2b DtlTitle">Citation:</div><div class="DtlLangs-2c DtlCell">КЛАССИФИКАЦИЯ РАСХОДОВ ПО ЦЕЛЯМ: КФОГУ, КИПЦ, КЦНО, КРПЦ, СЕРИЯМ № 84, Нью-Йорк: ОБЪЕДИНЕННЫХ НАЦИЙ.
ST/ESA/STAT/SER.M/84</div>                        <div class="DtlLangs-2a DtlCell"><a target="_blank" href=http://unstats.un.org/unsd/cr/registry/regdntransfer.asp?f=140>http://unstats.un.org/unsd/cr/registry/regdntransfer.asp?f=140</a></div>            </div></div>
            <div><div class="DtlLangs-1 DtlSubItem">中文</div><div class="DtlLangs-2"><div class="DtlLangs-2a DtlCell">按目的划分的个人消费分类 (COICOP)</div>
<div class="DtlLangs-2b DtlTitle">Citation:</div><div class="DtlLangs-2c DtlCell">ST/ESA/STAT/SER.M/84</div>                        <div class="DtlLangs-2a DtlCell"><a target="_blank" href=http://unstats.un.org/unsd/cr/registry/regdntransfer.asp?f=224>http://unstats.un.org/unsd/cr/registry/regdntransfer.asp?f=224</a></div>            </div></div>
</div>
        <div class="DtlCol2-1 DtlTitle">&bull; Availability:</div>
        <div class="DtlCol2-2 DtlCell">Fully available in all of the languages above</div>
    </div>
    <br />  
    <div class="headline"><h4>Purpose of the Classification</h4></div>
    <div style="margin-left:20px; margin-bottom:20px">
        <div>
           <div class="DtlCol2-1 DtlTitle">&bull; Statistical Domains (in CSA 2.0):</div>
            <div class="DtlCol2-2 DtlCell">106 Income and consumption, 20101 System of National Accounts, 20102 Balance of payments and international investment position</div>
        </div>
        <div>
            <div class="DtlCol2-1 DtlTitle">&bull; Purpose:</div>
            <div class="DtlCol2-2 DtlCell">To classify the purpose of individual consumption expenditures incurred by three institutional sectors, namely households, non-profit institutions serving households and general government</div>
        </div>
        <div>
            <div class="DtlCol2-1 DtlTitle">&bull; Main Applications:</div>
            <div class="DtlCol2-2 DtlCell">N/A</div>
        </div>
        <div>
            <div class="DtlCol2-1 DtlTitle">&bull; Main Users:</div>
            <div class="DtlCol2-2 DtlCell">N/A</div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <br />    
    <div class="headline"><h4>Methodology</h4></div>
    <div style="margin-left:20px; margin-bottom:20px">
        <div>
            <div class="DtlCol2-1 DtlTitle">&bull; Scope:</div>
            <div class="DtlCol2-2 DtlCell">N/A</div>
        </div>
        <div>
            <div class="DtlCol2-1 DtlTitle">&bull; Concept Being Classified:</div>
            <div class="DtlCol2-2 DtlCell">expenditures, goods, services</div>
        </div>
        <div>
        <div class="DtlCol2-1 DtlTitle">&bull; Statistical Units:</div>
            <div class="DtlCol2-2 DtlCell">products and services</div>
        </div>
        <div>
            <div class="DtlCol2-1 DtlTitle">&bull; Main Principles:</div>
            <div class="DtlCol2-2 DtlCell">N/A</div>
        </div>
                        <div class="DtlTitle" style="margin-top:15px;">&bull; Relationships to Other International Classifications:</div>
                <div class="DtlSubItem" style="margin-left:-30px;">
                    <div class="DtlCol2-1 DtlTitle" style="margin-left:20;">Related To:</div>
                    
                    <div class="DtlCol2-2 DtlTitle">Major Differences (Scope, Structure, and Concepts):</div>
                </div>
            <div class="DtlSubItem" style="margin-left:-30px;">
                <div class="DtlCol2-1 DtlCell">COICOP 1999 - CPC Ver. 1.0</div>
                <div class="DtlCol2-2 DtlCell"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="DtlSubItem" style="margin-left:-30px;">
                <div class="DtlCol2-1 DtlCell">COICOP - CPA 2002</div>
                <div class="DtlCol2-2 DtlCell"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="DtlSubItem" style="margin-left:-30px;">
                <div class="DtlCol2-1 DtlCell">COICOP - CPA 2008</div>
                <div class="DtlCol2-2 DtlCell"></div>
            </div>

    </div>
    <br />
    <div class="headline"><h4>Classification Structure</h4></div>
    <div style="margin-left:20px; margin-bottom:20px">
        <div class="DtlTitle">&bull; Definition of Structure:</div>
            
                    <div>
            <div class="DtlLevel-1 DtlTitle DtlSubItem">Level:</div>
            <div class="DtlLevel-2 DtlTitle">Level Name:</div>
            <div class="DtlLevel-3 DtlTitle">Code Format:</div>
            <div class="DtlLevel-4 DtlTitle">Number of Items:</div>
        </div>
            <div>
                <div class="DtlLevel-1 DtlCell DtlSubItem">Level 1</div>
                <div class="DtlLevel-2 DtlCell">Divisions (two-digit)</div>
                <div class="DtlLevel-3 DtlCell">-</div>
                <div class="DtlLevel-4 DtlCell">X items</div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="DtlLevel-1 DtlCell DtlSubItem">Level 2</div>
                <div class="DtlLevel-2 DtlCell">Groups (three-digit)</div>
                <div class="DtlLevel-3 DtlCell">-</div>
                <div class="DtlLevel-4 DtlCell">X items</div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="DtlLevel-1 DtlCell DtlSubItem">Level 3</div>
                <div class="DtlLevel-2 DtlCell">Classes (four-digit)</div>
                <div class="DtlLevel-3 DtlCell">-</div>
                <div class="DtlLevel-4 DtlCell">X items</div>
            </div>

    </div>
        <br/>
